                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-6">In the U.S., the LCR applies to banking organizations with total consolidated assets of $250 billion or more or total consolidated on-balance-sheet foreign exposures of $10 billion or more. A simpler, less stringent version of the LCR applies to other banking organizations with $50 billion or more in total consolidated assets. Banking organizations with total assets of less than $50 billion are not subject to LCR requirements.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-6" aria-label="Return from footnote 6.">Return to 6</a>
                    </li>
